{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_vrtx_01Eet3X5EEQviFqva2g4VehY","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Section 8: Observability & Analytics\n2\t\n3\t---\n4\t\n5\t## Q1\n6\t\n7\t**Problem framing**\n8\t\n9\tCheckout funnels are multi-step flows where users drop off at every stage. Without precise event instrumentation you can't tell whether users abandon at address entry, payment entry, or order review — meaning you optimize blindly. Granular events with consistent properties let you compute step-level conversion, run cohort analyses, and A/B-test individual stages.\n10\t\n11\t**Approach**\n12\t\n13\tDefine one event per discrete funnel boundary. Each event carries a shared \"envelope\" of properties plus step-specific ones.\n14\t\n15\t```typescript\n16\t// Shared envelope attached to every checkout event\n17\tinterface CheckoutEventBase {\n18\t  session_id: string;          // anonymous, per-tab\n19\t  checkout_id: string;         // idempotency key for this cart attempt\n20\t  user_id?: string;            // logged-in users only\n21\t  experiment_variants: Record<string, string>; // active A/B flags\n22\t  device_type: 'mobile' | 'tablet' | 'desktop';\n23\t  timestamp_ms: number;\n24\t}\n25\t\n26\t// --- Step events ---\n27\t\n28\t// Fired when checkout page first renders (before Stripe init)\n29\ttrack('checkout_started', {\n30\t  ...base,\n31\t  cart_total_cents: 4999,\n32\t  currency: 'USD',\n33\t  item_count: 3,\n34\t  coupon_applied: false,\n35\t});\n36\t\n37\t// Fired on first keystroke in any address field\n38\ttrack('shipping_address_started', { ...base });\n39\t\n40\t// Fired when address form passes validation and user advances\n41\ttrack('shipping_address_completed', {\n42\t  ...base,\n43\t  address_country: 'US',\n44\t  address_state: 'CA',\n45\t  validation_errors_count: 0,\n46\t});\n47\t\n48\t// Fired when Stripe Elements iframe is fully mounted and interactive\n49\ttrack('payment_form_viewed', {\n50\t  ...base,\n51\t  stripe_elements_load_ms: performance.now() - stripeInitStart,\n52\t  payment_methods_shown: ['card', 'apple_pay', 'google_pay'],\n53\t});\n54\t\n55\t// Fired on first interaction with card number field (focus event)\n56\ttrack('payment_details_started', {\n57\t  ...base,\n58\t  payment_method_type: 'card',\n59\t});\n60\t\n61\t// Fired when all card fields complete (Stripe onChange complete=true)\n62\ttrack('payment_details_completed', {\n63\t  ...base,\n64\t  payment_method_type: 'card',\n65\t  card_brand: 'visa',         // from Stripe's onChange event — safe to log\n66\t  card_funding: 'credit',\n67\t  is_saved_card: false,\n68\t});\n69\t\n70\t// Fired on \"Place Order\" button click — before any network call\n71\ttrack('checkout_submitted', {\n72\t  ...base,\n73\t  payment_method_type: 'card',\n74\t  total_cents: 4999,\n75\t  submission_attempt: 1,      // increments on retries\n76\t});\n77\t\n78\t// Fired when payment confirmation arrives from your backend\n79\ttrack('checkout_completed', {\n80\t  ...base,"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_vrtx_01UaWwr5g9rsejd9J7o3nAFU","session_id":"1a5460d5-3632-4573-89d5-4609d7db0f17","uuid":"abf7b729-7770-4d00-947d-74fe23601589","timestamp":"2026-06-20T19:34:32.308Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Write section 09 answers for payments-system design doc"}
